# Veteran Guardmouse: Valiant triggers only when it becomes the target of a spell or ability its controller controls. On turn 2
# Bot2 casts Giant Growth on Bot1's Guardmouse: it gets +3/+3 but nothing triggers (no first strike, no scry). Later that turn
# Bot1 targets it with a Giant Growth of its own: that is the first time this turn a spell Bot1 controls targets it, so Valiant
# triggers (+1/+0, first strike, scry 1, keeping the Forest on top) and the Guardmouse ends the turn a 10/10.

